                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJRQbog52vQjQRi702uNuQexQ/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psMlRISmlhVzEyWTJGMU1FeFBTM0pRUzAxaVMwRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "It felt like I was in Japan for a second. There are many chain stores in Taipei, and I am always curious every time I pass by. Last time, I met a client at Taipei Main Station in the afternoon and could only order coffee. The coffee was good, but I never had the chance to try the food. There are many shops on the ground floor of Shipai Road. I came here to try it out during breakfast time. Unfortunately, there were not many breakfast options, which was a bit of a pity!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "很有一秒到日本的感覺，台北已有許多連鎖店，每次經過都很好奇，上次下午時段約客戶在北車只有單點咖啡，咖啡味道不錯，一直沒有機會解鎖餐點，石牌路上一樓店面商家林立，適逢早餐時段特來解鎖，可惜早餐選擇不多，有一點可惜！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
